msgstr "Biremne ayırım kürsätkeçtä kürsätü"

#: filegroupdetails.cpp:42
msgid ""
"Here you can configure what the Konqueror file manager will do when you click "
"on a file belonging to this group. Konqueror can display the file in an "
"embedded viewer or start up a separate application. You can change this setting "
"for a specific file type in the 'Embedding' tab of the file type configuration."
msgstr ""
"Bu törkemgä kergän birem östenä çirtkän çaqta Konqueror atlı birem citäkçeseneñ "
"çağılışın bonda köyläp bula. Konqueror şul biremne berketelgän kürsätkeçtä "
"kürsätä ala, yä ki ayırım yazılımda aça ala. Birem töre caylawındağı 'Berketü' "
"tabağında bu köylämäne ayırım birem törläre öçen üzgärtep bula."

#: filetypedetails.cpp:38
msgid ""
"This button displays the icon associated with the selected file type. Click on "
"it to choose a different icon."
msgstr ""
"Saylanğan birem törenä kileştergän tamğanı bu töymädä kürep bula. Aña çirtep "
"başqa tamğa saylap bula."

#: filetypedetails.cpp:41
msgid "Filename Patterns"
msgstr "Birem Adı Sözgeçe"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:55
msgid ""
"This box contains a list of patterns that can be used to identify files of the "
"selected type. For example, the pattern *.txt is associated with the file type "
"'text/plain'; all files ending in '.txt' are recognized as plain text files."
msgstr ""
"Saylanğan törgä kileşterelgän ürnäklär bu tezmädä kürsätelä. Ürnäk itep *.txt "
"alsaq, ul 'text/plain' digän birem törenä kileşterelgän, yäğni ul “taqır yazma "
"bireme” kebek tanıla."

#: filetypedetails.cpp:60 filetypesview.cpp:96 kservicelistwidget.cpp:123
msgid "Add..."
msgstr "Östäw..."

#: filetypedetails.cpp:66
msgid "Add a new pattern for the selected file type."
msgstr "Saylanğan birem töre öçen yaña ürnäk östä"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:74
msgid "Remove the selected filename pattern."
msgstr "Birem adınıñ saylanğan ürnägen taşlaw."

#: filetypedetails.cpp:76
msgid "Description"
msgstr "Açıqlama"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:84
msgid ""
"You can enter a short description for files of the selected file type (e.g. "
"'HTML Page'). This description will be used by applications like Konqueror to "
"display directory content."
msgstr ""
"Saylanğan birem törenä berär qısqa açıqlama kertep bula (ü.ö. 'HTML Bit'). "
"Konqueror eçendä törgäk eçtälägen kürsätkändä dä ul açıqlamalar kürsätelä."

#: filetypedetails.cpp:108 filetypedetails.cpp:276
msgid "Use settings for '%1' group"
msgstr "Köyläwne '%1' törkeme öçen qullanası"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:111
msgid "Ask whether to save to disk instead"
msgstr "Anıñ urınına disk eçenä saqlawın sorísı"

#: filetypedetails.cpp:114
msgid ""
"Here you can configure what the Konqueror file manager will do when you click "
"on a file of this type. Konqueror can display the file in an embedded viewer or "
"start up a separate application. If set to 'Use settings for G group', "
"Konqueror will behave according to the settings of the group G this type "
"belongs to, for instance 'image' if the current file type is image/png."
msgstr ""
"Bu törkemgä kergän birem östenä çirtkän çaqta Konqueror atlı birem citäkçeseneñ "
"çağılışın bonda köyläp bula. Konqueror şul biremne berketelgän kürsätkeçtä "
"kürsätä ala, yä ki ayırım yazılımda aça ala. 'Törkem caylawın qullanası' "
"saylanğan çaqta Konqueror çağılışnı şul birem törkemeneñ calawınnan alaçaq, "
"ü.ö. 'image/png' digän birem töreneñ törkeme 'image' bula."

