msgstr "&Tabası birem adı ürnäge:"

#: filetypesview.cpp:73
msgid ""
"Enter a part of a filename pattern. Only file types with a matching file "
"pattern will appear in the list."
msgstr ""
"Birem adı öleşennän ürnäk kertäse. Biredäge tezmä aña kileşkän biremnär genä "
"kürsäteläçäk."

#: filetypesview.cpp:83
msgid "Known Types"
msgstr "Belgän Törlär"

#: filetypesview.cpp:90
msgid ""
"Here you can see a hierarchical list of the file types which are known on your "
"system. Click on the '+' sign to expand a category, or the '-' sign to collapse "
"it. Select a file type (e.g. text/html for HTML files) to view/edit the "
"information for that file type using the controls on the right."
msgstr ""
"Bu sanaqta bilgele bulğan birem törlären bu ağaçlı tezmädä kürep bula. Anıñ "
"'+/-' bilgelärenä çirtep, büleklären cäyep/törep bula. Berär birem tören "
"saylağaç (ü.ö. HTML biremnär öçen \"text/html\"), uñ töymälärne qullanıp ul "
"törlek turında belemne kürep/üzgärtep bula."

